![high](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/high-priority.svg)

In the original `KpiDashboard.tsx` implementation, the `createdDate` fell back to `issue.created` if `issue.fields?.created` was not defined. In this extracted component, that fallback was omitted, which will cause the date to display as `'N/A'` for issues that only have the flat `created` property. Let's restore the fallback to ensure correctness.

```suggestion
                  const createdDate =
                    issue.fields?.created || (issue as any).created;
```

